---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<BaseLayout pageKey="legal" lang="en" noindex>
  <div class="bg-tile">
    <PageHero
      lang="en"
      title="Legal Notice"
      lead="Legal notice for the Geneva Sports Club Pickleball website: information about the publisher, the host, the editorial responsibility, and the applicable law."
    />
    <section class="py-12 px-4">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <article
          class="bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-2 p-8 md:p-12 text-gray-800 leading-relaxed prose-legal"
          style="border-color: #002b2b;"
        >
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">
            Last updated: 28 April 2026
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 mt-2 text-gray-900">Publisher</h2>
          <p class="mb-2"><strong>Geneva Sports Club</strong> (multi-sport association)</p>
          <p class="mb-2">La Jonction, 1205 Geneva, Switzerland</p>
          <p class="mb-2">
            Email: <a href="mailto:hello@genevasportsclub.ch" class="text-teal-700 underline">hello@genevasportsclub.ch</a><br />
            Phone: <a href="tel:+41762141203" class="text-teal-700 underline">+41 76 214 12 03</a>
          </p>
          <p class="mb-6">
            Main association website:
            <a href="https://genevasportsclub.ch/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-teal-700 underline">https://genevasportsclub.ch/</a>
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 mt-8 text-gray-900">Editorial responsibility</h2>
          <p class="mb-6">
            Editorial responsibility lies with the committee of the Geneva Sports Club association. For any editorial inquiry,
            please contact <a href="mailto:hello@genevasportsclub.ch" class="text-teal-700 underline">hello@genevasportsclub.ch</a>.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 mt-8 text-gray-900">Hosting</h2>
          <p class="mb-6">
            The website <a href="https://pickleballgeneva.netlify.app/" class="text-teal-700 underline">https://pickleballgeneva.netlify.app/</a>
            is hosted by <strong>Netlify, Inc.</strong>, 512 2nd Street, Suite 200, San Francisco, CA 94107, United States —
            <a href="https://www.netlify.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-teal-700 underline">https://www.netlify.com/</a>.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 mt-8 text-gray-900">Intellectual property</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            All content on this website (texts, images, logos, videos, animations, layout) is protected by copyright and neighbouring rights.
            Any reproduction, representation or distribution, in whole or in part, without prior written consent from Geneva Sports Club
            is prohibited and would constitute infringement under the Swiss Code of Obligations and the Federal Act on Copyright (CopA).
          </p>
          <p class="mb-6">
            The trademarks and logos mentioned on this site (in particular "Geneva Sports Club", "GSC Pickleball") are the exclusive
            property of the Geneva Sports Club association, or of their respective owners for third-party trademarks (e.g. Meetup, Lottie,
            YouTube, Netlify).
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 mt-8 text-gray-900">Limitation of liability</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            Geneva Sports Club makes every effort to provide accurate and up-to-date information but cannot guarantee the accuracy,
            completeness or currency of information published on this site. Use of the website is at the user's sole responsibility.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-6">
            Geneva Sports Club shall not be liable for any direct or indirect damage resulting from access to the site, its use,
            or any malfunction, nor for the content of third-party websites linked from this site.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 mt-8 text-gray-900">External links</h2>
          <p class="mb-6">
            This site may contain links to external sites (notably Meetup, YouTube, Lottie, Amazon, Google Maps).
            Geneva Sports Club has no control over these sites and disclaims any responsibility for their content, privacy practices
            or service availability.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 mt-8 text-gray-900">Personal data</h2>
          <p class="mb-6">
            The processing of personal data collected through this site is described in our
            <a href="/en/privacy-policy/" class="text-teal-700 underline">privacy policy</a>.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 mt-8 text-gray-900">Applicable law and jurisdiction</h2>
          <p class="mb-6">
            This website and this legal notice are governed by Swiss law. In the event of a dispute and failing an amicable settlement,
            the courts of the canton of Geneva shall have exclusive jurisdiction.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
